  "text_md": "Draft Document for Review December 11, 2019 1:55 pm **8459p02.fm**\n\n# Part 2\n\n**Part 2 Red Hat OpenShift**\n\nThis part induces Red Hat OpenShift, provides an overview of the modular components and services, planning (for installation) considerations, preparing an environment and deploying an OCP instance. The following chapters are included in this part: Chapter 4, “Red Hat OpenShift components and architecture” on page 55 Chapter 5, “Red Hat OpenShift installation planning and considerations” on page 67 Chapter 6, “Installing Red Hat OpenShift 3.11 on IBM PowerVC” on page 95\n\n© Copyright IBM Corp. 2019. All rights reserved.\n",
